<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Car Transport from Bangalore to Siliguri | Express Enclosed Carrier
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does it typically take for a car to be transported from Bangalore to Siliguri?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The transit distance of approximately 2,469 km is covered via national highway arterial corridors and multi‑axle express freight highways. Under normal traffic conditions, our enclosed carrier completes the journey in 5‑6 days, with real‑time GPS updates ensuring you can monitor progress at every stage.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What insurance coverage is included with the car transport service?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Every vehicle shipped by our packers and movers bangalore to siliguri service is covered by a 100 % declared‑value, IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance. This protects against loss, theft, or accidental damage, and the policy details are provided in the documentation package before loading.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Do I need to prepare any documents before the vehicle is loaded?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. You must provide a valid RTO registration certificate, insurance copy, original tax receipt, a signed e‑Way bill, and a GST‑compliant invoice. Our team also verifies the vehicle’s fitness certificate and any loan clearance letters to ensure smooth customs and state‑level clearance.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my car while it is on the road?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Our fleet is equipped with satellite GPS devices that feed live location data to a customer portal. You can view the exact position, estimated arrival time, and any route deviations in real time, matching the standards of transdaksh packers and movers bangalore tracking.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What safety measures prevent scratches or dents during loading?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We follow a zero‑scratch protocol that includes a joint pre‑inspection, hydraulic ramp loading with soft‑rubber rollers, 4‑wheel lock securing, and custom edge‑padding using high‑density foam and wooden crates. Each step is documented with photos to guarantee damage‑free transit.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is the cost for car shifting from Bangalore to Siliguri calculated?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The price is derived from four key factors: total distance, vehicle dimensions and weight, selected insurance coverage, and any optional services such as door‑to‑door delivery or expedited handling. Our transparent pricing matrix breaks down each component, ensuring no hidden fees.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
